2. The Minister for Finance assigns to the Inland Revenue Authority of Singapore the following functions:
(a)administering the Jobs Support Scheme introduced in the Budget Statement of the Government dated 18 February 2020;
(b)disbursing payments under the SkillsFuture Enterprise Credit introduced in the Budget Statement of the Government dated 18 February 2020;
(c)disbursing the foreign worker levy rebate introduced in the Ministerial Statement on Additional Support Measures in Response to Elevated Safe Distancing Measures dated 6 April 2020.
